@{ var m = (SitePageModel)Model!; var lang = m.Lang; }

<section class="hero hero-glow">
    <div class="wrap">
        <p class="crumb"><a href="/@lang/games">Oyunlar</a> / Block Boosters</p>
        <div class="hero-grid">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <span class="eyebrow reveal">Boosters Labs oyunu</span>
                <h1 class="reveal reveal-d1">Block Boosters</h1>
                <p class="lead reveal reveal-d2">
                    Bloklari birlestir, kombolari yakala, her bolumde biraz daha zorlanan bir bulmaca/aksiyon
                    deneyimine dal. Kolayca kavranir, birakmasi zordur.
                </p>
                <div class="tags mt-2 reveal reveal-d2">
                    <span class="pill pill-gold">Bulmaca / aksiyon</span>
                    <span class="pill">Aile dostu</span>
                    <span class="pill">Yakinda</span>
                </div>
                <div class="actions mt-3 reveal reveal-d3">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/@lang/contact">@m.T("cta.contact")</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="/@lang/games">@m.T("cta.back.games")</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-art reveal reveal-d2">
                <img class="hero-mark" src="~/img/mark-dark-512.png" alt="Block Boosters amblem" width="320" height="320" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="head-block center">
            <span class="eyebrow reveal">Oyun hakkinda</span>
            <h2 class="reveal reveal-d1">Basit kurallar, derin keyif</h2>
            <p class="lead center reveal reveal-d2">
                Hizli oynanis ve tatmin edici mekaniklerle her oturumda birkac dakikaligina ya da
                uzun uzun oynamaya davet eden bir oyun.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-3 mt-4">
            <article class="card reveal">
                <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M9 3H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5M15 3h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v5M9 21H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-5M15 21h5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Sezgisel kontroller</h3>
                <p>Ilk saniyeden itibaren anlasilir. Ogrenmesi dakikalar, ustalasmasi keyifli.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card reveal reveal-d1">
                <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M13 2L3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Tatmin edici mekanikler</h3>
                <p>Her hamle yerine oturur; kombolar ve zincirler oynamayi bagimlilik yapici kilar.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card reveal reveal-d2">
                <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 12h4l3 8 4-16 3 8h4"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Giderek zorlasan bolumler</h3>
                <p>Yumusak bir baslangic, zamanla artan zorluk. Ustalastikca yeni mekanikler acilir.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card reveal">
                <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 13s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><path d="M9 9h.01M15 9h.01"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Aile dostu</h3>
                <p>Her yastan oyuncuya uygun, temiz ve pozitif bir deneyim. Birlikte oynamaya uygun.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card reveal reveal-d1">
                <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 20h8M12 18v2"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Temiz, modern gorsellik</h3>
                <p>Goze hos gelen, sade ve akici bir arayuz. Dikkati oynanista tutan net tasarim.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card reveal reveal-d2">
                <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.4-3 7.7-7 9-4-1.3-7-4.6-7-9V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Adil ve akici</h3>
                <p>Oyuncuyu merkeze alan, akiciligi bozmayan bir deneyim hedefliyoruz.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="split">
            <div class="reveal">
                <span class="eyebrow">Oynanis</span>
                <h2 class="mt-2">Birkac dakika ya da saatlerce</h2>
                <p class="lead">
                    Block Boosters, kisa molalarda hizlica oynanacak kadar basit, uzun oturumlarda
                    sizi icinde tutacak kadar derin. Her bolum yeni bir meydan okuma sunar.
                </p>
                <ul class="ticks mt-2">
                    <li>Hemen baslayin; karmasik menuler yok</li>
                    <li>Her bolum kendi ritmini ve bulmacasini getirir</li>
                    <li>Ilerledikce acilan yeni mekanikler</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="split-media reveal reveal-d1">
                <div class="center">
                    <img class="hero-mark" src="~/img/mark-light-512.png" alt="Block Boosters" width="200" height="200" />
                    <h3 class="mt-3">Odaklan, birlestir, yuksel</h3>
                    <p>Sade mekanik, derin keyif.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section navy">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="split flip">
            <div class="split-media reveal">
                <div class="center">
                    <img class="hero-mark" src="~/img/mark-light-512.png" alt="Block Boosters" width="200" height="200" />
                    <h3 class="mt-3">Mobil ve web</h3>
                    <p>Yakinda.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="reveal reveal-d1">
                <span class="eyebrow">Platform</span>
                <h2 class="mt-2">Yakinda oyuncularla bulusuyor</h2>
                <p class="lead">
                    Block Boosters'i mobil ve web icin hazirliyoruz. Cikis yaklastikca ayrintilari
                    burada paylasacagiz. Haberdar olmak icin bizimle iletisime gecebilirsiniz.
                </p>
                <div class="actions mt-3">
                    <a class="btn btn-light" href="/@lang/contact">@m.T("nav.contact")</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="cta-band reveal">
            <h2>Cikistan ilk siz haberdar olun</h2>
            <p class="lead">Block Boosters hakkinda gelismeleri ogrenmek ya da is birligi icin bize yazin.</p>
            <div class="actions center">
                <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/@lang/contact">@m.T("cta.contact")</a>
                <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="/@lang/games">@m.T("cta.back.games")</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
